 "remarks": "GORGEOUS cottage for rent! Newly renovated, bright and exceptionally spacious one bedroom cottage, with bonus room. First floor has huge open plan living/dining/kitchen with overheight cathedral ceilings and architectural beams. Also on first floor oversized primary bedroom with built in closets and ample space for king bed as well a sitting area. The primary bedroom has French doors leading out to private back yard. The second floor boasts bright and sunny bonus room which could be used for office/den or second bedroom. New kitchen and bathroom. Next to Tamarack golf club, conveniently located for Westchester, NYC and all that Greenwich offers. A really exceptional rental. Be the first to live in this entirely newly renovated cottage! Not to be missed",
